    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "The rendering algorithms differ in quality and CPU cost.",
      "ko": "렌더링 알고리즘은 품질과 CPU 비용에서 서로 다릅니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4ecc3311db3e47c3fad05712879804a324345c4b1ce43a7eeb808c89192fdf50",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "[`AVAudio3DMixingRenderingAlgorithm.equalPowerPanning`](avaudio3dmixingrenderingalgorithm/equalpowerpanning.md) is the simplest panning algorithm and the least expensive computationally.",
      "ko": "[`AVAudio3DMixingRenderingAlgorithm.equalPowerPanning`](avaudio3dmixingrenderingalgorithm/equalpowerpanning.md)는 가장 단순한 패닝 알고리즘이며 계산 비용이 가장 낮습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "806064dca0198be1dc333b2145ad9527e97d790b3cd712a72398b4b83d0ff3b0",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "When rendering to multichannel hardware, most of the rendering algorithms only render to channels 1 and 2, excluding [`AVAudio3DMixingRenderingAlgorithm.soundField`](avaudio3dmixingrenderingalgorithm/soundfield.md) and [`AVAudio3DMixingRenderingAlgorithm.auto`](avaudio3dmixingrenderingalgorithm/auto.md).",
      "ko": "멀티채널 하드웨어로 렌더링할 때 대부분의 렌더링 알고리즘은 채널 1과 2만 렌더링하며 [`AVAudio3DMixingRenderingAlgorithm.soundField`](avaudio3dmixingrenderingalgorithm/soundfield.md)와 [`AVAudio3DMixingRenderingAlgorithm.auto`](avaudio3dmixingrenderingalgorithm/auto.md)는 제외됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "166e885944491bfae4e8e6b209e2bfd994b4eea70b6c95020e0d357a87538d59",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
